  "body": "## Fincept Terminal v4.5.1\n\nNative C++20 financial intelligence terminal — Qt6, embedded Python analytics, 50+ screens.\n\n### Downloads\n\n| Platform | File | Install |\n|----------|------|---------|\n| **Windows x64** | `FinceptTerminal-*-setup*.exe` | Run installer |\n| **Linux (Debian/Ubuntu)** | `FinceptTerminal-*-linux-x64.deb` | `sudo dpkg -i *.deb` |\n| **Linux (Fedora/RHEL)** | `FinceptTerminal-*-linux-x64.rpm` | `sudo dnf install *.rpm` |\n| **Linux (portable)** | `FinceptTerminal-*-linux-x64-setup.run` | `chmod +x` then run |\n| **macOS Apple Silicon** | `FinceptTerminal-*.dmg` or setup | Open DMG → drag to Applications |\n\n### Requirements\n- Windows 10/11 x64\n- Ubuntu 20.04+ / Debian 11+ / Fedora 36+ / RHEL 9+\n- macOS 13+ (Apple Silicon)\n\nSee the [README](https://github.com/Fincept-Corporation/FinceptTerminal#readme) for full installation instructions.\n",
